{%- comment -%}
  Post-CONFIRMATION page. The redirect target of the confirmation link in the
  giveaway confirm email (data/giveaway/nurture/00-confirm-request.html).

  WHY THIS PAGE EXISTS SEPARATELY FROM page.giveaway-entered.
  "Entered" is reached by submitting the form and says "go check your email".
  This page is reached by CLICKING the link in that email — the entrant has just
  done the thing that page asked for, and repeating the ask would be the one
  clear way to waste the moment. Before this page existed, a confirming entrant
  landed on Klaviyo's generic "you're subscribed" page, which sells nothing,
  asks for nothing, and is not on our domain.

  IT CANNOT KNOW WHO THE VISITOR IS. Klaviyo's update_property_link takes its
  redirect as a STATIC url — the tag supports no dynamic content and cannot be
  nested inside another tag — so there is no way to append ?e={{ email }} the
  way 01-confirm.html does for the entered page. Everything here therefore has
  to work for an anonymous visitor. That is why the referral ask sends them to
  the entry page to grab their link rather than rendering a personalised one,
  and why there is no live entry count on this page.

  The single job of this page is the REFERRAL rung: +5 entries per confirmed
  friend, up to 10 friends, which is the largest rung an entrant can still move
  after confirming. Second job is a full-price purchase path, because a page
  that earns attention and offers no way to buy is unfinished work.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign set_handle = 'sensitive-skin-starter-set'
  assign set_image = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0270/1911/6579/files/frame-01-what-arrives.jpg?v=1785635169'
-%}

{{ 'giveaway.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<section class="gv-entered" data-gv-confirmed>
  <div class="gv-entered-main">

    <h1 class="gv-entered-title">Confirmed — that's 3 entries.</h1>
    <p class="gv-entered-lede">
      Your email is confirmed, which banks <strong>+2 entries</strong> on top of
      your base entry. Your running total is recalculated once a day, so if the
      entry page hasn't caught up yet, it will by tomorrow morning.
    </p>

    <div class="gv-ladder">
      <h2 class="gv-ladder-title">The biggest rung left is referrals</h2>
      <p class="gv-ladder-body">
        Every friend who enters and names your email address as their referrer is
        worth <strong>+5 entries</strong> — up to 10 friends, so up to 50 entries.
        That is more than every other action on the page combined.
      </p>
      <p class="gv-ladder-body">
        There is no unique referral link. Your friend just types the email address
        you entered with into the referral field on the entry form, so send them
        the entry page and tell them which address to use.
      </p>
      {%- comment -%}
        The entry page's handle is `free-soap-giveaway`, NOT `giveaway` —
        /pages/giveaway 404s. Every nurture email (02-referral, 05-reminder,
        06-final-call) already uses the full handle; this link shipped wrong for
        one upload and is the referral CTA, the most valuable action on the page.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <a class="gv-next-cta" href="/pages/free-soap-giveaway">Get the entry page to share</a>
      <p class="gv-ladder-fine">
        Both halves have to happen: your friend must enter <em>and</em> confirm
        their own email before the +5 is credited.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gv-ladder">
      <h2 class="gv-ladder-title">Two more, while you're here</h2>
      <p class="gv-ladder-body">
        Answering three quick questions on the entry page is worth
        <strong>+3 entries</strong>, and posting about us with
        <strong>@realskincare_com</strong> tagged is worth another
        <strong>+3</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="gv-fine">
      Entries close <strong>September 14, 2026</strong>; we draw on
      <strong>September 16</strong>. A $536.40 prize. Entering is free.
      No purchase necessary. Purchases do not earn entries.
      <a href="/pages/giveaway-official-rules">Official rules</a>.
      This promotion is not sponsored, endorsed, or administered by Meta.
    </p>
  </div>

  <aside class="gv-next">
    <div class="gv-next-card">
      <img class="gv-next-img" src="{{ set_image }}" alt="Sensitive Skin Moisturizing Set" loading="lazy" width="480" height="480"/>
      <h2 class="gv-next-title">Don't want to wait for the draw?</h2>
      <p class="gv-next-body">
        Three of these ship with the prize, one a year. Two products, eight
        ingredients, no fragrance — the body lotion and body cream that go
        alongside the soap you just entered for.
      </p>
      <p class="gv-next-price">$46.80</p>
      <a class="gv-next-cta" href="/products/{{ set_handle }}">See the Set</a>
      <p class="gv-next-fine">Buying doesn't change your entries.</p>
    </div>
  </aside>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Giveaway confirmed",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Giveaway confirmed" }]
}
{% endschema %}
